cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
title: >-
  OncoStratify-BRCA: Interpretable Machine Learning for Breast Cancer
  Molecular Subtype Classification from Transcriptomic Data
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Boyue
repository-code: "https://github.com/boyue-boboyue/precision-brca-transcriptomics"
url: "https://github.com/boyue-boboyue/precision-brca-transcriptomics"
abstract: >-
  A leakage-controlled and reproducible machine-learning workflow for
  classifying PAM50 breast cancer molecular subtypes from TCGA-BRCA RNA-seq
  profiles, with locked patient-level evaluation, model interpretation,
  biological validation, and robustness analyses.
keywords:
  - breast cancer
  - transcriptomics
  - TCGA-BRCA
  - PAM50
  - machine learning
  - precision oncology
  - explainable AI
license: MIT
